      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present this superb two-bedroom terraced home to the market at No. 9 Melvin Road, Terenure, Dublin 6W.\nThis impressive property is presented in immaculate, turnkey condition throughout and is sure to appeal to a wide range of buyers. The accommodation boasts a lovely open-plan layout, creating bright and spacious living and entertaining areas, while both bedrooms are generously proportioned. The property further benefits from coming to the market vacant with no onward chain, allowing for a smooth and straightforward purchase.\nIdeally positioned in the highly sought-after Terenure area, No. 9 Melvin Road enjoys an enviable location with a host of amenities close by. Terenure Village and it's excellent selection of shops, cafés, restaurants and bars are within easy reach, while a number of well-regarded schools, parks and recreational facilities are also nearby. Excellent transport links provide easy access to Dublin City Centre and surrounding areas, with the M50 also readily accessible.\nThe property itself is presented in exceptional condition throughout, requiring little or nothing for its new owners to do. Consisting of c. 68 sqm of internal floor space, the home briefly comprises of; an entrance hallway, spacious living area leading into the fully fitted kitchen and dining area. The rear features a sunny low maintenance rear garden. Upstairs hosts the master bedroom featuring fitted wardrobes, family bathroom and the second bedroom overlooking the rear garden. The combination of this home's superb presentation, versatile open-plan living space, sought-after location and vacant possession makes this an ideal choice for first-time buyers, downsizers or investors alike.\nFurther features include low-maintenance front and rear gardens and double-glazed windows throughout, while the overall presentation and turnkey condition make this a fantastic home for any buyer seeking a property they can move straight into and enjoy from day one.\nEarly viewing is highly advised to appreciate the quality, presentation and excellent location of this wonderful home.\nFeatures:\n•2 bed / 1 bath terraced home\n•C. 68 sqm of internal floorspace\n•BER D\n•Immaculate, turnkey condition throughout\n•Lovely open-plan living layout\n•Low-maintenance front and rear gardens\n•Double-glazed windows throughout\n•Vacant with no onward chain\n•Ideally located in sought-after Terenure\n•Excellent selection of amenities nearby\n•Excellent transport links\n•BER D2\nDirections\nEircode -D6W E166\n"
      },
      {
